// 289's anvils (skill_smithing/configs/smithing/smithing.loc) on 2011's: the
// locs named Anvil in cache 786 that are placed in the decoded map, outside
// Daemonheim (37316 and the 50195+ anvils) and the Ancient Cavern of
// Barbarian Training (39458 and 40200, by its rough hewn steps and dragon
// heads); 24744 and 24765 are placed nowhere. 289's anvil (2783),
// doric_anvil (2782) and viking_anvil (4306) keep their ids; the rest are
// 2011's. Their examines moved here from
// examine.loc; those examine.loc lacked take 289's anvil's. 289's
// forceapproach and model are the client's, so they are left to the cache.

